review:
Prequel to the Serious Sam: The First Encounter, gameplay-wise is a classic FPS with some modern elements. Overall game is fun and frantic, but first couple levels have pacing problems and they feels very out of place. Can recommend it if you like classic FPS.

Pros:
- Impactful gunplay;
- Impressive visuals;
- Good sound design;
- Insane gameplay;
- Enemy diversity;

Cons:
- Bad optimisation;
- Inconsistent pacing;
- Some fights are too drag out;
- Bugs and glitches;
